From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sofian <sofianbll.x@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 19:58:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Mac: a Pro Controller clone read as raw HID takes report
 0x3F's buttons, full sticks and its player lights

Adapt seedds/nxnative PR #989 (f99ed57fe38e60e108444407c6d494b91f26170c) to the f25fa956 pin and the shared controller registry.

Detect Nintendo's report 0x3F from HID button elements, use its button numbering and rest-relative raw-axis calibration, and set player lights after the registry assigns a slot. Preserve the landed #859 GameController admission behavior and the existing twin Pro Controller path.

Upstream-Status: forwarded seedds/nxnative#989
Reason: Map Nintendo report 0x3F buttons, calibrate PowerA sticks and set player lights.
Issue: seedds/nxnative#989
